    "1": {
      "purpose": "System Requirement Specification (SRS)\n\nPurpose: This System Requirement Specification (SRS) defines the system-level requirements for the telemetry acquisition subsystem of [Project Name]. The purpose of this software is to acquire and process real-time telemetry data from various sensor channels, enabling critical mission operations in a defense environment. The system will support existing parent systems by providing reliable and timely access to critical operational data. This SRS is intended for use by developers, engineers, testers, and other stakeholders involved in the development and deployment of this software.\n\nNote:  This document outlines the high-level requirements for the telemetry acquisition subsystem. It does not cover detailed design or implementation details such as specific sensor types, data processing algorithms, or REST API implementation details.",
      "scope": "STR - Scope\n\nIntroduction\n\nThis Software Requirements Specification (STR) outlines the scope of the Defence R&D software project.  The project's scope encompasses the development and testing of two test items and features, as defined in STP.generated [2 Test Items and Features].\n\nNote: This STR will be updated to reflect any changes to the project scope.",
